      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spruce_Hill%2C_Philadelphia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Spruce Hill’s Victorian rowhouses, many now multi‑family apartments, showcase the neighborhood’s preserved architectural heritage.",
